# Ryoma's reply kinds (Norg; his script: Twenty in Pirate Years / True Will; default 94) between Bugi Soden (184 E once
# per zone; 185 / 188 E, 189 P), I'll Take the Big Box (135 P, available) and Ayame and Kaede (95 P at Prog 4).
# main (a level 75 Ninja, katana skill 2500, the Kodachi of Trials held, Twenty in Pirate Years completed, a GM): both
# offers: 135 (Progress) beats 184 (Event); finished: Big Box begun. 184 (handler's turn), option 1: Bugi Soden begun.
# 185 on the script's turn (his script does nothing: the lookup goes on), option 1: the kodachi held: nothing. True Will
# accepted with trueWillCS 1 (GMs): 185 (the handler's turn), his script's 138, 185; the map (a GM): 138 (the script's
# turn), 188; the annals (a GM): 189 (Progress) over the script's turn: completed.
# bob (the same, Big Box and True Will completed: his script does nothing; Ayame and Kaede accepted at Prog 4, GMs): 95
# (Progress) beats 184; finished: Ayame and Kaede Prog 5. 184, option 1: begun. The annals and Ayame and Kaede's Prog 4
# (GMs): 95 and 189 tie: the last id 184: 95 (bastok's container first); Prog 4 again (a GM): the last id 95: 189
# (completed); then 95 alone.
lists Norg/Ryoma/onTrigger
char zone=Norg pos=-26.276,0.53,-8.323 job=NIN lvl=75
char bob zone=Norg pos=-26.276,0.53,-8.323 job=NIN lvl=75
skill Katana 2500
item KodachiOfTrials
quest Outlands.TwentyInPirateYears completed
bob: skill Katana 2500
bob: item KodachiOfTrials
bob: quest Outlands.TwentyInPirateYears completed
bob: quest Outlands.ILlTakeTheBigBox completed
bob: quest Outlands.TrueWill completed
bob: quest Bastok.AyameAndKaede accepted
bob: charvar Quest[1][60]Prog 4
login
trigger Ryoma                           # 135 (Progress) beats 184 (Event)
finish                                  # Big Box begun
trigger Ryoma                           # 184
finish option=1                         # Bugi Soden begun
trigger Ryoma                           # the script's turn (nothing): 185
finish option=1                         # the kodachi held: nothing
quest Outlands.TrueWill accepted        # a GM
charvar trueWillCS 1                    # a GM
trigger Ryoma                           # the handler's turn: 185
finish option=1
trigger Ryoma                           # his script's turn: 138
finish
trigger Ryoma                           # 185
finish option=1
keyitem MapToTheAnnalsOfTruth           # a GM
trigger Ryoma                           # his script's turn: 138
finish
trigger Ryoma                           # 188
finish
keyitem AnnalsOfTruth                   # a GM
trigger Ryoma                           # 189 (Progress) over his script's turn
finish                                  # completed
logout
bob: login
bob: trigger Ryoma                      # 95 (Progress) beats 184
bob: finish                             # Ayame and Kaede Prog 5
bob: trigger Ryoma                      # 184
bob: finish option=1                    # begun
bob: keyitem AnnalsOfTruth              # a GM
bob: charvar Quest[1][60]Prog 4         # a GM
bob: trigger Ryoma                      # 95 and 189 tie: the last id 184: 95
bob: finish
bob: charvar Quest[1][60]Prog 4         # a GM
bob: trigger Ryoma                      # the last id 95: 189
bob: finish                             # completed
bob: trigger Ryoma                      # 95 alone
bob: finish
bob: logout
